  "notes": "{暮|く}らし describes how one lives day-to-day.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {暮|く}らしが{楽|らく}だ/きつい (life is easy/hard)\n- {暮|く}らしを{立|た}てる (to make a living)\n- {暮|く}らし{向|む}き (living conditions)\n\nAS SUFFIX (becomes ぐらし):\n- {一人|ひとり}{暮|ぐ}らし (living alone)\n- {二人|ふたり}{暮|ぐ}らし (living as a couple)\n- {田舎|いなか}{暮|ぐ}らし (country living)\n- {都会|とかい}{暮|ぐ}らし (city living)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {暮|く}らす (to live)\n- {生活|せいかつ} (life, livelihood - more formal)",
